### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "username": "test.user.jwt",
  "email": "test.user.jwt@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "a",
  "password": "a"
}

### Refresh (replace with refreshToken from login/register response)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Me (replace token with accessToken from login/register response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Profile Page (authenticated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Feed (authenticated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/feed
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create Post (authenticated)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "caption": "Created from http file",
  "imageUrl": "/mock/post-canyon.svg",
  "locationLabel": "HTTP Request"
}

### Like Post 1 (authenticated)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unlike Post 1 (authenticated)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete Post 1 (authenticated, only owner can delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
